{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Good:</b> The sense is: He will destroy all His enemies in His fierce anger when His wrath is poured out, when He grows wrathful against them and brings troubles upon them — and those who fear Him will escape. And this is: \"a stronghold,\" like \"a tower of strength.\"" "<b>And trust in Him:</b> It is joined to \"stronghold,\" and He added the word \"and He knows,\" for He alone knows the hidden things of the heart and recognizes those who trust in Him."], :book :nahum, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nahum -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nachum"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:28.666565684Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}